{
 "question": "Does a per-linear analytic shrinkage intensity of the output-side sketch H_O toward its diagonal (Schafer and Strimmer 2005, target D) replace the fixed alpha 0.5 of qreg-yaqash: token samples as the unit (-yaqalw) or sequences as the unit (-yaqalb, batch means)?",
